diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -76,14 +76,14 @@ for Japanese-language learning research. The intended flow is child-led:
 }
 ```
 
-- Polls the same page at 4, 4.5 and 5 seconds from fetch start, at most three
-  times. It does not repeat the search.
+- Requests one browser snapshot at 15 seconds from fetch start. That single
+  evaluation checks a 400ms local DOM quiet window; it does not repeat the search.
 - Returns answer text in `data.ai_overview.text` and up to five ordinary results
   in `data.web`. Results remain usable without an overview; read linked pages
   later when the conversation calls for them.
 - `data.ai_overview.status` is for caller code. Pass only answer text or search
   results to a dialogue model, not the status. No failure sentence is generated.
-- The fetch budget is 5.5 seconds, plus up to 250ms for connection cleanup.
+- The fetch budget is 16 seconds, plus up to 250ms for connection cleanup.
   Initial client startup is separate. Visible mode selects the search tab before
   waiting and leaves it open for the child even when no overview is available.
 - Google layouts and generation availability vary. Retrieval does not verify
